csO8jno7TnIz2M4TVUmvgYxxa9iaGP4TTEkj7Bc0mtWBa5PYNiaTPFkBm7xkdVuJO3zohyw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/vFjvBibAEzlTicibxIeoicsO8jno7TnIz2M4TVUmvgYxxa9iaGP4TTEkj7Bc0mtWBa5PYNiaTPFkBm7xkdVuJO3zohyw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/nqbT4xjjCtzCFabzjR981TDMvndvR5B3KBmRVurPgMXydtibicKibB6pksXOBcVsHwjQkuic1DBJgazJOPibQuDuHBg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为了促进全国各高校优秀大学生的互动与交流，培养大学生从事科学研究的兴趣，并为优秀本科生提供了解我院学术科研环境和与专家、学者交流的机会，我院将于2026年7月9日（线上）举办“2026年四川大学外国语学院优秀大学生暑期夏令营”。夏令营期间将举行学科介绍、政策宣讲、导师云见面、专家讲座等一系列活动。现面向全国高校招收营员，相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>一、申请流程</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/Le3HfxDib3BCMXiaArS1dCT4Pksxgqmxib91gEdWALdyibDTib9D92BDHAj8PTZ0ePECzCkszt9NlRCuTe0PwuItOnA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>(1) 申请者须为全国高校外国语言文学专业及其他相关专业本科三年级在读学生（2027届应届本科毕业生）。申请者应学习成绩优良，专业成绩及综合排名位居前列，具有较强的科研兴趣、创新意识和学术发展潜力。</span></p><p><span>(2)思想政治表现合格，遵守学术道德和学术规范，无学术不端行为，无违纪记录。</span></p><p><span>(3) 外语水平达到专业四级及以上水平或大学英语六级（570分以上），或托福、雅思和GRE等考试成绩优秀者。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2。申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>(1) 申请表（报名成功后由系统自动生成，下载后经所在学院推荐盖章后再上传至系统）；</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>(2) 本科成绩单和专业排名证明（各1份，需加盖所在学校教务处或所在学院公章）；</span></p><p><span>(3) 个人陈述1份（请用约1500字介绍你的学术背景、在所申请的专业曾经作过的研究工作、以及攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划等）；</span></p><p><span>(4) 其他证明材料复印件（如论文、获奖或资格证书、专业外语四级、大学英语六级等各类英语考试成绩单、日语语言文学专业考生还需要提供日语能力考试1级考试成绩单和证书扫描件）各1份。</span></p><p><span>注：请自觉保证所提供材料的真实性，我院夏令营组委会将对材料进行认真复核，材料如有不实将取消录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/Le3HfxDib3BD5ZSaDAeibibpT6ibKoVp5v4ndCzWm6PXkM7DiccO45mHvcVMA4Im1lqWeAR2zhSaib9ZG0dlqAIibftXQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请办法及时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 报名时间：即日起至2026年6月30日上午12点（以网上报名系统填报时间为准）。</span></p><p><span>2. 报名方法：申请人登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平台（https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly）进行报名.</span></p><p><span>3. 申请人按照以下顺序：将申请表、个人陈述、本科成绩单、专业排名证明、相关获奖证书、专业四级考试证书的扫描件（日语语言文学专业考生还需要提供日语能力考试1级考试成绩单和证书扫描件）、学术成果等扫描件合并到一个pdf文档，以“姓名-本科学校-申请专业-夏令营材料.PDF”的文件名上传报名系统。接收材料的截止时间：2026年6月30日上午12点。</span></p><p><span>4. 录取结果：最终入营录取名单请于7月初自行登录四川大学研究生招生信息网夏令营网报平台（https://yz.scu.edu.cn/xly ）查询，届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><span>时间</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>备注</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>7月9日上午</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>云开营仪式，学科介绍、营员与导师组交流</span></strong></p></section></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><section><p><span>具体行程见入营QQ群通知</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><span>7月9日下午</span></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>学术讲座、朋辈引导</span></strong></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/6cSuN9jnVicicY4mjQnAH4I3nFRRgUzWnFZOGLshKlmVMJEFkjWYvnZjfcY8fS0r47ibOcJs8ibKCqj8M5B2eVFBXjr4dQsOg5FwaVHaibfyEbHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 在营期间进行的一切相关活动，禁止录音录像。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 在营期间，营员必须遵守四川大学的相关规定，且做好自身的安全防护工作。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/WtGxFgC2Gsibfhtc1QVk0EU2JdVfxCJUROUfEt2CZQUwjtIEoicx6sIWntGSpk78gQemGd475whSJmjYHPHA9eEQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询电话：</span></strong><span>028-85412160，</span><span><span>028-85410020</span></span></p><p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span>刘老师，韦老师</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/iaGH323X4wqNyUzfWHG1TTw9GRMf1puXxa17pplxYhwt5jNiaIDDphEBW2XjCkdzCF2eBs2yPicVhiafFLUR5GjuvQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></sect